
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Fancy Tunes Account Recovery</title>
</head>
<body>
  <h2>Account Recovery</h2>
  <p>Dear <%= name %>,</p>
  <p>We received a request to reset your password. Please use the verification code below to proceed with the password reset process:</p>
  <h3 style="color: blue;"><%= verificationCode %></h3>
  <p>If you did not request a password reset, please ignore this email.</p>
  <p>Best regards,<br/>The Fancy Tunes Team</p>
</body>
</html>